  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</a> </span>has released the skill test Final Result for the post of Stenographer group C, D. This recruitment was released for 1590 posts. Applications for the SSC Stenographer C, D Recruitment 2025 were accepted from June 06, 2025, to June 26, 2025. The skill test examination was conducted on 28-29 January 2026. Candidates who qualified for this examination can download their SSC Stenographer Group C, D Final Result 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SSC Stenographer Group C, D Final Result 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>06 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>26 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>26 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>06, 07, 08 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>31 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>04 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>04 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>28 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Final Answer Key/ Marks : <strong>03 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Skill Test Date&nbsp;: <strong>28-29 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Skill Test Exam City Details : <strong>21 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Final Result : <strong>18 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, Female <strong>: Rs. 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Stenographer C, D Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age : <strong>27 Years (Grade-D)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30 Years (Grade-C)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per SSC Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Stenographer C, D 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 1590</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SSC Stenographer Grade-C</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">230</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SSC Stenographer Grade-D</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1360</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SSC Stenographer C, D Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.3548%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6452%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.3548%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Stenographer Grade-C</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6452%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have passed the 10+2 (Intermediate) examination from any recognized board in India are eligible to apply. As part of the selection process, transcription is required with a time limit of 40 minutes for English and 55 minutes for Hindi.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.3548%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Stenographer Grade D</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.6452%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have passed the 10+2 (Intermediate) examination from any recognized board in India are eligible to apply. The transcription test duration is 50 minutes for English and 65 minutes for Hindi.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download SSC Stenographer Final Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Check the Important Links section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Open the Download Final Result link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After that, a new page will be opened in which candidates have to provide <strong>Roll Number / Application Number &amp; DOB</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates are suggested to download the Final Result &amp; save the pdf file for the future reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can download the Final Result also from the official website of SSC.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Stenographer C, D Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Online Examination CBT</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Skill Test</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"